      "text": "Transfer to the Airport to board your flight to Asunción, the welcoming capital of Paraguay.\n\nYou arrive at Asunción International Airport, the capital city of Paraguay. Transfer to the Hotel. You visit the Museo del Barro, also known as the Museum of Clay. It is a beautiful colonial mansion that holds an amazing collection of contemporary art, crafts, and indigenous cultural expressions from the people of Paraguay. You then stroll along the historic buildings of the city centre and down to the waterfront of the Paraguay River. "
